            "action_name": {
              "value": "Devour Curse"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, primal)\n\nThe imprecasia casts remove curse against a curse afflicting a creature, but with a cast of two actions rather than 10 minutes. If they succeed in removing the curse, they also drain vitality from the creature, causing it to become drained 1 unless it succeeds at a 30 Fortitude save (drained 2 on a critical failure). If the curse is removed, the imprecasia doesn't expend that use of remove curse as a primal innate spell."
            },
